		"@okikio/entitlement": {
			"module_doc": {
				"doc": "Declare which paid or enabled feature an operation requires without coupling its definition to a billing provider. Scattered plan-name comparisons otherwise make the same feature mean different things in different services.\n\nAttach the requirement to a resource, activity or endpoint, then configure an entitlement interpreter at the application root. The definition documents a required capability; it does not itself allow access. Unknown requirement families reject unless the owner explicitly chooses another policy. Use exact imported definitions so billing policy and runtime admission describe the same feature.\n",
				"tags": [
					{
						"kind": "example",
						"doc": "```ts\nimport * as entitlement from '@okikio/entitlement';\nimport * as requirement from '@okikio/requirement';\nconst Export = entitlement.define({ id: 'export.csv', description: 'Export rows as CSV.' });\nconsole.log(requirement.document(entitlement.require(Export))[0]?.definition);\n```\n"
					},
					{
						"kind": "module"
					}
				]
			},
